# ── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: .env.production is intentionally TRACKED. The frontend is a static Vite
# build; its VITE_* values (API URL, Stripe PUBLISHABLE key, GA id) are all
# public — they ship in the browser bundle — and the CI pipeline needs this file
# at build time. It must NOT contain any secret (no sk_live, no API secrets).
.env
.env.local
.env.development
